From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:17:38 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tool-search): tools.tool_search.eager keeps named tools
 and toolsets direct

A tool, or every tool of a toolset, named in tools.tool_search.eager is never
deferred behind the tool_search bridge, so the model calls it directly. A tool
that defer names itself still defers inside an eager toolset. Default [] keeps
today's split.
---
 hermes_cli/config_defaults.py                 |  4 ++
 tests/tools/test_tool_search.py               | 51 +++++++++++++++++++
 tools/tool_search.py                          | 37 +++++++++++---
 .../docs/user-guide/features/tool-search.md   |  2 +
 4 files changed, 86 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

